= Fernando de los Rios

Fernando de los Rios is a law professor, humanist and one of the most respected moral figures of democratic socialism. He advocates for republican education as the true driver of social transformation.

- @misiones_pedagogicas
- @education_minister_action
- @democratic_rally
- @constitutional_defense
- @root: Return to main

@misiones_pedagogicas
title: Pedagogical Missions
subtitle: Bring culture, books, and cinema to rural villages with the help of republican intellectuals.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; rural_psoe += 4; smallholders_psoe += 4; catholics_psoe += 2; pro_republic += 2; education_rural_schools += 1

We send travelling libraries, theatrical troupes, and educational films to isolated rural communities. This cultural outreach builds respect for the Republic and the socialist movement without inciting class warfare.

@education_minister_action
title: [Ministry] Direct Educational Policy
subtitle: Use our control of the Education Ministry to build secular schools.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if psoe_in_government = 0 : PSOE not in government: ?] [? if education_minister_party != "PSOE" : The PSOE does not control the education ministry. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and psoe_in_government == 1 and education_minister_party == "PSOE"
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; education_policy_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: education_policy

@democratic_rally
title: Rally for democracy
subtitle: Rally our party and the Spanish people to defend democracy and freedom.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; pro_republic += 5; democratization += 1; besteiristas_strength += 5; prietistas_strength += 3; workers_psoe += 4*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 2; middle_psoe += 3*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 3

De los Rios helps us to rally the people in defense of democracy.

@constitutional_defense
title: Constitutional Defense
subtitle: Reduce political tension through dialogue with moderate politicians.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if radicalization > 4 : The PSOE contributes too much to the polarization to be credible: ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and radicalization < 5
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; polarization -= 4

Leveraging his immense personal prestige, De los Rios acts as a diplomatic bridge between the left and middle-class republicans, lowering polarization and stabilizing the regime.
